er":{"title":"The river king","author_id":3175,"first_publish_year":2000,"open_library_id":"OL48903W","cover_id":null,"source_type":"open_library","work_type":"novel","native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL48903W"}},{"ref":"e4","relation":"editions","key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL53547563M"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w4","open_library_edition_id":"OL53547563M","isbn_13":"9789041761316","isbn_10":null,"title":"Onder water","language":"dut","publisher":"Zilver Pockets"}},{"ref":"d4","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":"@w4","language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w4","language":"nl","bound_author_id":3175,"text":"In Haddan leven de plaatselijke bevolking en de leerlingen van een prestigieuze school grotendeels langs elkaar heen. Een onverklaarbare dood brengt die werelden samen en legt oude scheidslijnen bloot. Rechercheur Abel Grey wil de gebeurtenis niet zonder grondig onderzoek laten passeren. Voor verschillende betrokkenen raken persoonlijke geheimen verweven met de geschiedenis van de gemeenschap. De roman volgt hoe één sterfgeval de verhoudingen verandert tussen mensen die dachten te weten welke plaats zij in het stadje innamen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://alicehoffman.com/books/the-river-king/","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p290895502"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-038.json#149","checked_at":"2026-11-03T08:04:14.628Z","note":"AliceHoffman The River King2000, HaddanSchool and investigatorAbelGrey; Dutch Onder water9789041761316 is complete novel, not2005film or originalpublicationyear2005."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://alicehoffman.com/books/the-river-king/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL48903W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p290895502"],"review":"content-review-010.json"},{"type":"explicit_contrib